Subject: [PATCH 5/6] test(server): the terminal preset tests mock no module:
 featureOptions.terminal takes a host-built terminalService

The last vi.mock of another package's internals (a spy over platform's createTerminalService, in two server suites) is gone.
The lifecycle test builds the service itself and hands it to the preset (the guidance error already promised that option);
the service tests call buildTerminalService with a recording createService. Red first by mutation: ignoring the host service turns
two tests red, dropping the undefined filter turns one red. it() counts: terminal-service 4 -> 5, terminal-lifecycle 1 -> 1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
